 "topic": "Your first car registration is free (Moses at Watkins Auto Parts, Port Gellhorn, Chapter 2; respray free too), a one-time deal; later registrations cost money, so register the best tracker-free car you want to keep (e.g. the Penumbra FF on Vespucci Island)",
